SIZE 35 mm, 25 mm
GAP 3 mm, 0 mm
DIRECTION 0,0
REFERENCE 0,0
OFFSET 0 mm
SET PEEL OFF
SET CUTTER OFF
SET PARTIAL_CUTTER OFF
SET TEAR ON
CLS
CODEPAGE 1252
; Body is generated by _print_marker_label. TSPL's own alignment argument is
; not supported across all TSC firmware, so every line is given the same
; anchor instead, which under rotation 180 is the edge the reader sees first
; -- one anchor, one left margin. The anchor is worked out from the SIZE line
; above, so changing the stock there moves the text with it. That maths needs
; the head resolution as well: this printer is 300 dpi and TSPL counts 12 dots
; to the millimetre on it, which is _MARKER_DPMM in test_console.py.
@body@
PRINT 1,1
